Title: No. 19
Author: Harold Horowitz
Date: 1925-03-07
Byline: The above Puzzle was contributed by Harold Horowitz, 123 Hartley Hall, Columbia University, New York.
Source: https://archive.org/details/sim_judge_1925-03-07_88/page/n34/mode/1up
